“Qual nível de suporte ou mediação será considerado?”

Options:

• alto suporte visual e guiado;
• suporte moderado;
• autonomia progressiva;
• configuração personalizada.

STEP 5 — QUESTION FORMAT

Allow:

• multiple choice;
• visual association;
• true or false;
• completion;
• matching;
• sequencing;
• adapted open response;
• drawing response;
• oral response;
• practical activity;
• mixed activity.

STEP 6 — QUANTITY AND LAYOUT

Allow:

• number of questions;
• font size;
• answer-space size;
• one question per block;
• one question per page;
• portrait or landscape;
• color or grayscale;
• student copy;
• Teacher guidance;
• Support Professional guidance;
• separate answer key.

Every selected option must change the generated activity.

Do not create decorative controls that have no implementation.

